@startuml
' Figure 6.6  The unattended fare-watch path (designed in January 2026)
' Reading order: top to bottom. A schedule starts the loop, the policy
' engine checks the cap and the daily budget, and a sample of the
' issued vouchers goes to people the next day.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Fare\nwatch" as L <<ops>>
participant "Policy\nengine" as P <<policy>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<ops>>
actor "Audit" as S <<org>>
L -> P : Voucher
P -> P : Cap, budget
P -[#1A1A1A]> G : Permission
G -> L : Effect record
...next day...
G -[$TRAIL]-> S : 5% sample
@enduml
